  "discussion": {
    "headline": "nother round of severe storms today, then quiet and refreshing",
    "dateLine": "1:00 p.m. Tuesday, July 21, 2026",
    "excerpt": "The week kicked off on a mostly sunny and pleasant note across northern MD and southeastern PA with high temperatures in the comfortable low-to-mid 80s Monday afternoon. Unfortunately, the tranquil conditions will be replaced by volatile weather and another round of severe storms this afternoon and evening. Much like Saturday, the Storm Prediction Center (SPC) has placed most of PA and the Delmarva Region in an \"enhanced risk\" for severe weather. …",
